text.section:
To support the needs of a qualified company, and other manufacturers and companies engaged in research and development in and near a qualified county, up to $2,525,000 shall be made available to a comprehensive community college and a baccalaureate public institution of higher education in or near an eligible county. Subject to appropriation, such funds are expected to be available in the Commonwealth's fiscal years beginning July 1, 2020, through July 1, 2024, as follows:

$730,000 for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2020;


$493,750 for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2021;


$493,750 for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2022;


$493,750 for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2023; and


$313,750 for the Commonwealth's fiscal year beginning July 1, 2024.
